          "mechanism": "Race and ethnicity affect both the distribution of pregnancy history across populations and hypertension prevalence, treatment patterns, and medication intensity.",
          "justification": "COMPASS is designed to capture a multiethnic cohort, and differential hypertension care patterns across ethnic groups are well-documented.",
          "role": "confounder",
          "proxy_for": null,
          "contestable": false
        },
        {
          "variable": {
